<<play 서은표_흠>>
은표 : …?!
<<show pyo_neg>>
은표: {name()}, 그거 나쁜 거야.
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<choice_again>>
===

title: 서은표_두명
---
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<notice "당신은 분위기가 싸해짐을 느꼈다.">>
<<change karma +2>>
은표 : ...
<<bgm_stop>>
<<show pyo_horror>>
은표: 뒤에 누구야?
<<wait  2>>
<<bgm_resume>>
<<show pyo_neg>>
은표 : 둘이서만 얘기했으면 좋겠는데.
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<choice_again>>
===

